ey said that you get a little wet.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: A little wet? Awesome. We didn`t know -- we still --\par \par \uc2 KOTB: Oh my god.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: We step in and it came up. I`m so --\par \par \uc2 KOTB: What? By the way --\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: I`m soaking wet.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: We`ll see right here.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Let`s all slide down there.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: What (inaudible) say?\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: He said it`s here to help people, and to help them communicate and smile, and enjoy themselves.\par \par \uc2 JONES: Which we`re smiling.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: We did, we are. It`s open to the public and it`s free. It`ll be here through September 9th and scheduling your blowout for Apple.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: Y`all have a great experience?\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Yes.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: I mean, it does -- I know.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: You see, a little bit.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: By the way, it is a cool moment, all right? Are you good?\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: No -- yes.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: OK. Meantime, guys, tomorrow we`re going to be in our usual spot -- no.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: It`s not going to get you.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: Are you sure?\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: I think I`m afraid of water.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: The wave is coming, OK. Tomorrow, we`re going to be usual spot over there, a walk in the plaza. Conan Gray is going to be here. He`s going to take our Citi Concert stage.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Oh my gosh. Oh my gosh.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: So we want to tell you about another great concert that we have locked up. I`m going to try to stay put. This mega talented Charlie Puth will be here on Friday.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Charlie`s favorite.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: Yes, July 8.\par \par \uc2 (INAUDIBLE)\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Do we take shower this morning? Why are we so afraid?\par \par \uc2 KOTB: All right, anyway. Wait. By the way, I was going to plan this summer to get my hair wet more often.\par \par \uc2 GUTHRIE: Yes.\p