g to be into the mid to upper 90s. And look at the records today, stretching all the way from Houston, Texas, up into parts of the Midwest, St. Louis, looking at temperatures that could hit records as well. And that`s going to last right on into the weekend. And the good news guys is we finally are going to be looking at warmer conditions along the eastern seaboard with temperatures getting into the 70s and 80s into the weekend from Boston all the way down to Richmond.\par \par \uc2 We`re going to get to your local forecast coming up in the next 30 seconds.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 (LOCAL NEWS)\par \par \uc2 [07:20:27]\par \par \uc2 ROKER: And that is your latest weather. Guys?\par \par \uc2 KOTB: All right, Al, we`ll check back with you in just a little bit.\par \par \uc2 Coming up guys, we have new details on the Americans who died under mysterious circumstances at that popular resort in the Bahamas and the many unanswered questions that remain in the investigation. We`ll have the very latest.\par \par \uc2 LLAMAS: Plus, the Queen, opting out of a treasured royal tradition this morning, a decision that`s raising new concerns about her health. We`ll take you live to London. But first is Today on NBC.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 LLAMAS: Coming up, we have something really special this morning, right, an incredible story on the bond between a young patient and a nurse with the heart of gold.\par \par \uc2 KOTB: Little Rocco had a need and his nurse, Cassie, went above and beyond to fill it. I was lucky to meet them. We`ll have touching reunion, after your local news.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 [07:26:20]\par \par \uc2 (LOCAL NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 [07:30:19]\par \par \uc2 KOTB: We`re back at 7:30. Look at our sunny little corner the world, well it`s about to get the sunny, Rockefeller Plaza. It`s a Tuesday morning, May 10th, 2022. Guy, I look forward to the days where jackets a